Subject: [RFC PATCH 0/1] Handle DP83843 PHY differences in sunhme
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Handle the DP83843 reset and vendor-register differences encountered on
PRIMEPOWER LAN#0. This driver change applies independently to v7.3-rc1.
Earlier integrated PRIMEPOWER kernels used LAN#0 for SSH and transfers.

The exact cleaned integration booted PRIMEPOWER UP/SMP and kept LAN#0
available for SSH throughout serial and PCI#01 transfer/IRQ tests.
Tests used the integrated stack; no new PHY variant or standalone
kernel qualification is claimed.

